Share-alike obligation
-----------------------

Under CC-BY-SA 4.0, any adapted or derived version of this rulebook content must
be distributed under the same license, with attribution preserved. This applies
to the Markdown in this directory, to the rules text extracted from it into the
string values of `rules/i18n/<lang>/`, to translations of that text into further
languages, and to any other derivative produced from any of them.

It does not extend to the JSON *form* that text is stored in, nor to the
language-neutral mechanics in `rules/core/`, which are this project's own work
and are MIT-licensed. Shipping the two together in one installer or archive is a
collection, not an adaptation.

This project is an unofficial fan tool. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by,
or endorsed by Atlas Games.
